Read `AGENTS.md` (rules) and `BRIEF.md` (source of truth) before any change. Work one ticket from `docs/TICKETS.md` per branch (`nec-XX-short-name`).

Non-negotiables:
- No Flight IP (`@flight-digital/*`, FlightDeck, Linaria). No secrets in the App bundle.
- Never touch Sanity project `dyewmg78`. Ours is `v9dl2xdi`.
- Every `@sanity/workflow-*` package is exactly `0.35.0`. Check the engine CHANGELOG before porting sandbox (0.28) code.
- No destructive or org-level commands without Taylor's explicit go.
- `bun run typecheck && bun run test` green before every PR. Use the PR template in AGENTS.md, including "Deviations from brief" and "Build-log notes".
- If the brief is wrong, stop and say so in the PR. Don't invent around it.
